{"3592440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Project Freefall", "steam_appid": 3592440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <i>Project Freefall, </i>free to play in Alpha, where the stakes are as high as the altitude. You and up to seven friends are plummeting towards the earth in this adrenaline-pumping game of tag... but there’s only ONE parachute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are simple: survive. The parachute drops from the plane. Your job? Skydive out of the plane and grab it for yourself. Toss a grenade, spray a fire extinguisher, or dodge the shark as you weave through the clouds in a high-speed aerial chase where alliances are temporary and gravity is permanent. As the ground rushes up to meet you, the intensity skyrockets. It's a hilarious, high-skill dance of chaos where only one can claim the ultimate victory, leaving the rest to an… explosive landing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592440/extras/9a865f3a7e89c2ca04eea5069574c53f.poster.avif?t=1778161680\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592440/extras/9a865f3a7e89c2ca04eea5069574c53f.webm?t=1778161680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592440/extras/9a865f3a7e89c2ca04eea5069574c53f.mp4?t=1778161680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8-Player Mayhem: Invite your squad for the ultimate test of friendship and reflexes. More players mean more chaos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross-Platform Play: Dive in from either PC or VR. Everyone plays together in the same sky.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game Voice Chat: Talk with your friends as you plummet through the air.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-Stakes, Simple Rules: Easy to learn, but mastering aerial maneuvers to secure the win at the last second takes true skill.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592440/extras/a444d9a1a31a037e58a5fd537501e0a4.poster.avif?t=1778161680\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592440/extras/a444d9a1a31a037e58a5fd537501e0a4.webm?t=1778161680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flex Your Style: Look good while you fall! <i>Project Freefall</i> lets you shop for unique characters and Diver suits to customize your look.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are you waiting for? Download for free and join our Discord to help shape the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It’s a race to the bottom - will you land with a prize or a splat?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592440/extras/20a2ec1ebb29de65fa70d7808be71b51.poster.avif?t=1778161680\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592440/extras/20a2ec1ebb29de65fa70d7808be71b51.webm?t=1778161680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592440/extras/20a2ec1ebb29de65fa70d7808be71b51.mp4?t=1778161680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <i>Project Freefall, </i>free to play in Alpha, where the stakes are as high as the altitude. You and up to seven friends are plummeting towards the earth in this adrenaline-pumping game of tag... but there’s only ONE parachute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are simple: survive. The parachute drops from the plane. Your job? Skydive out of the plane and grab it for yourself. Toss a grenade, spray a fire extinguisher, or dodge the shark as you weave through the clouds in a high-speed aerial chase where alliances are temporary and gravity is permanent. As the ground rushes up to meet you, the intensity skyrockets. It's a hilarious, high-skill dance of chaos where only one can claim the ultimate victory, leaving the rest to an… explosive landing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592440/extras/9a865f3a7e89c2ca04eea5069574c53f.poster.avif?t=1778161680\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592440/extras/9a865f3a7e89c2ca04eea5069574c53f.webm?t=1778161680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592440/extras/9a865f3a7e89c2ca04eea5069574c53f.mp4?t=1778161680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8-Player Mayhem: Invite your squad for the ultimate test of friendship and reflexes. More players mean more chaos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross-Platform Play: Dive in from either PC or VR. Everyone plays together in the same sky.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game Voice Chat: Talk with your friends as you plummet through the air.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-Stakes, Simple Rules: Easy to learn, but mastering aerial maneuvers to secure the win at the last second takes true skill.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592440/extras/a444d9a1a31a037e58a5fd537501e0a4.poster.avif?t=1778161680\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592440/extras/a444d9a1a31a037e58a5fd537501e0a4.webm?t=1778161680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flex Your Style: Look good while you fall! <i>Project Freefall</i> lets you shop for unique characters and Diver suits to customize your look.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are you waiting for? Download for free and join our Discord to help shape the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It’s a race to the bottom - will you land with a prize or a splat?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592440/extras/20a2ec1ebb29de65fa70d7808be71b51.poster.avif?t=1778161680\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592440/extras/20a2ec1ebb29de65fa70d7808be71b51.webm?t=1778161680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592440/extras/20a2ec1ebb29de65fa70d7808be71b51.mp4?t=1778161680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Grab your squad and dive into a frantic chase for the lone parachute as you play the ultimate game of tag at 10,000 feet! Toss a grenade, spray a fire extinguisher, or dodge the shark as you skydive with your friends. Will you go on to victory or go splat? Free to play in Alpha.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592440/1876d2ae84bbb7c74ea779035e5644af06cd3b39/header.jpg?t=1778161680", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592440/5944ac68544078cc6359f588b6098c23b2fbfc7a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778161680", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592440/5944ac68544078cc6359f588b6098c23b2fbfc7a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778161680", "website": "https://playfreefall.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, x64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4590<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11, x64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7-8700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 2060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong>